---
description: Route CRM development tasks to addyosmani agent-skills workflows
alwaysApply: true
---

For software delivery tasks, prefer skills in `.cursor/skills/` from the
agent-skills pack. Start with `using-agent-skills` to pick the right workflow.

Common routes:
- New feature / spec → `spec-driven-development`, `incremental-implementation`
- Tests first → `test-driven-development`
- Review → `code-review-and-quality`
- Security → `security-and-hardening`
- API design → `api-and-interface-design`
- Ship / deploy → `shipping-and-launch`

Combine with ECC agents (`ecc-planner`, `ecc-architect`) when planning is needed.
